00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:23.498
Well, if you don't
have data, you can--

00:03:23.498 --> 00:03:24.540
Google has got your back.

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:27.820
You can use one of
Google's models.

00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:29.140
Here's a handful of models--

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:32.110
here's a handful of API's
